WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:08.200
Not every company deserves the same effort.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:19.140
Each company is a lead with a stage in its lifecycle - from Lead, to M-Q-L when its people show interest, to S-Q-L when there is a real opportunity, all the way to Customer.

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:23.775
The company's lead score aggregates the behaviour of all its contacts.

00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:33.319
We filter by stage, prioritise the hot companies, and in the acquisition funnel we see the end-to-end conversion, from first contact to the sale.

